[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30800500_01_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30800500_01_0010","text":"这里就是教堂呢\n好像是相当久以前建造的……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30800500_01_0020","text":"超～级漂亮～！\n就像外国的建筑一样！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30800500_01_0030","text":"听说可以进去参观哦"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30800500_01_0040","text":"雾子也要进去～！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30800500_01_0041","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30800500_01_0045","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30800500_01_0050","text":"哇……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30800500_01_0060","text":"这里，一直都在举办婚礼呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30800500_01_0070","text":"好厉害～……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30800500_01_0080","text":"呵呵……\n嗯……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30800500_01_0090","text":"一直……守护着……\n这里呢……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30800500_01_0100","text":"好多的……光芒……"}]
